{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Your dwelling is enduring.</b> You settled with Israel in enduring land — in the wilderness, in land not sown." "<b>And set your nest in the rock.</b> And for this reason, in the time when they are exalted and strong, your nest will be with them, as the Sages of blessed memory said: \"Who dwelled with you in your poverty — upon him shall it fall in your wealth.\""], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:41:04.473848387Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}